---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy notice | Lakehouse Tools" description="How Lakehouse Tools handles the information you send through this website.">
  <article class="section post">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="post-meta">Last updated: September 27, 2026</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>When you send a question through a form on this site, we receive what you enter (your question, name, work email and, if you give it, your company), the page you sent it from, and whether you asked for updates.</p>
        <p>This site doesn't use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>
        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To reply to your question.</li>
          <li>If you ticked "Keep me posted", to email you about new posts and lht releases. Every such email lets you unsubscribe.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We don't sell your information or share it with anyone for their marketing.</p>
        <h2>Who processes it</h2>
        <p>Form submissions are delivered to us by <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy">Formspree</a>, and our email is hosted by Google Workspace. The site is hosted on DigitalOcean.</p>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>To see, correct or delete what we hold about you, or to stop updates, email <a href="mailto:dan@lakehousetools.com">dan@lakehousetools.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
